      "id": "claim_a8e760f3958f40b7a9b91303d295d952",
      "statement": "playRandomQueue filters playable songs, applies mood-slot candidate filtering when active, delegates to RandomQueuePlanner.planRandomQueue, and on success exits infinite mode, replaces the in-memory recent-played set with the plan's, and starts the batch via setPlayQueue(plan.songs, 0, PlayMode.SEQUENTIAL); it returns false and starts nothing when no songs are playable.",
