      "statement": "PlaybackController detects a window-tail wrap by index (isMediaItemWrap: new index 0 and previous index was the last item) rather than by transition reason, because Media3 reports a REPEAT_MODE_ALL tail wrap as SEEK (manual) or AUTO (natural end) while MEDIA_ITEM_TRANSITION_REASON_REPEAT only means single-item repeat; AUTO/SEEK/REPEAT transitions all route to onMediaItemEnded, so headset/lock-screen/notification skips also refill infinite mode.",
