    {
      "id": "claim_5de11798fcfc471baf4b987ea640eb08",
      "statement": "Mood time-slot filtering happens at the planner entry, not inside the planners: when the slot is active, filterByMoodTags narrows the candidate pool to songs whose emotion tags intersect the slot's tags, and tiered selection plus recent eviction are reused unchanged on that pool (uniform random composes); an empty filtered pool logs 'fall back to full library' and returns null so playback falls back to full-library random, and pools below MoodSlotPolicy.POOL_WARN_THRESHOLD=10 log a loop warning. Slot configs and emotion tags are Volatile snapshots on PlayerRuntime with an injectable nowMinuteOfDay.",
